flowchart LR
    C[Codex session] -->|candidate argv| R[Project Rules]
    R -->|prefix policy decision| V[WSL2 Validation Runner]
    V --> I[Pre-execution HEAD integrity check]
    I --> P[Full argv and profile semantic validation]
    P --> A[Canonical validation commands]
    A --> S1[uv lock --check]
    A --> S2[pytest]
    A --> S3[Ruff check]
    A --> S4[Ruff format check]
    A --> S5[mypy]
    A --> S6[git diff --check]
    S1 --> E[Structured result]
    S2 --> E
    S3 --> E
    S4 --> E
    S5 --> E
    S6 --> E
    E --> D[Compact model-visible digest]
    E --> L[Ignored full logs]

    X[Direct uv / python / shell / GitHub write] -. not allowed by Task #83 Rules .-> R
    R -. prefix allow can occur .-> Y[Allowed profile plus trailing argv]
    Y -. runner rejects before validation .-> V
    T[Timeout or interrupt] --> G[Process-group TERM/INT then KILL]
    G --> E
